  "description": "A/O Limited Edition Colors featuring a unique 'Water-Transfer' painting technique. Each model water transfer is done by hand and will be unique from one bicycle to the next. There may be small differences and unnoticeable imperfections in the graphics, as it is the nature of these painting techniques.\n\nThis is an ideal choice for women who commute or enjoy longer weekend rides.\n\nThe sleek frame and thin hybrid tires will allow you to set a quick pace with minimal effort. The upright riding style is easy on the joints and the extra large saddle will keep you comfortable and pain free whether you measure your rides in miles or days of the week.\n\nCruise when you can. Race when you want to. Ride with unshakable grace.",
